<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
	<title>Intel Resource and Design Center Registration Email Template</title>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<style type ="text/css"> 
	
	
	/* IE8 COMPENSATE FOR HTML5 COMPATIBILITY */
	article, aside, figure, caption, figcaption, footer, header, main, nav, section, summary {
	display: block;
	}

	
	/* STRUCTURE */
	body {
	-webkit-text-size-adjust: none;
	background-color:#f9f9f9;
	background: url('https://tstcqcontent-ssl.cps.intel.com/etc/designs/intel/us/en/images/gradiantbg-body.png') repeat-x scroll left top #f9f9f9;
	height: 100%;      
	outline: medium none;
	}
	
	#container { /* "Container" contains all the layout code, sets page width in (pixels), and easily centers page. */
	width: 600px;  /* Good width of the vast majority of computer screens - 960px is standard because most users have 1024×768 resolution or higher */
	margin-top: 10px; /* Outside the container line */ 
	margin-right: auto; /* "auto" centers horizontally: tells the web browser to automatically calculate the space that is left over at the left and right of the #container */
	margin-bottom: 10px;
	margin-left: auto;  /* "auto" centers horizontally: tells the web browser to automatically calculate the space that is left over at the left and right of the #container */
	position: relative;  /* "relative" because using things called floats */  /* position options {"relative", "absolute"} */
	background-color: #FFFFFF;
	border-color: #E5E5E5;
	border-style: solid;
	padding: 25px 50px 0px 50px; /*top right bottom left  -- Inside the container line */ 
	border-width: 1px;
	overflow: hidden;   
	line-height: 1.5em;
	}
	
	
	hr {
	background-color: #E5E5E5;
	color:#E5E5E5;
	border: 0 none;
	height: 1px;
	}	


	img.floating {  /* image with text around it */ 
	float: right;
	padding: 4px 0px 0px 50px;  /** top right bottom left **/ 
	}


	/* TEXT STYLES */
	body {
	font-family: "Intel Clear", Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; 
	font-weight: normal;
	font-size: 10pt;
	color: #666666;
	}
	
	header {
	font-family: "Intel Clear Pro", Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif;
	font-weight: normal;
	font-size: 1.1em;
	color: #003C71;
	line-height: 2em;
	}
	
	section  {
	font-size: 0.8em;	
	font-style: italic;
	color: black;
	line-height: 1.4em;
	}
	
	footer  {
	font-size: 0.9em;
	line-height: 1.4em;
	}
	
	footer a {
	text-decoration: none;
	}
	
	a {
	color: #086DB6;
	}
	
	.intelBlueTextStyle {
	color: #086DB6;
	}
	
	.subjectTextStyle {
	font-size: 1.2em;
	font-weight: bold;
	color: #086DB6;
	line-height: 1.4em;
	}
	</style>
</head>


<body>
<div id="container"><header>
<h1><img src="https://messagecenter-cons.intel.com/v1/images/uploads/5104bda0-0fc2-11ec-901e-3750230d5760.png" alt="" title="devzone-premier-header_720x160@2x.png" /></h1>
<hr /><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"></span></header><main>
<p class="subjectTextStyle"><span>Pending Approval</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">
Your Application is Pending Approval</span></p>
<p><br /><span style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #086db6; font-size: 10pt;">Welcome {!PRM_Registration_Request__c.PRM_First_Name__c} {!PRM_Registration_Request__c.PRM_Last_Name__c},</span></p>
<p><span>Thank you for registering for a Developer Zone Premier Account.If you don't yet have a Corporate Non-Disclosure Agreement (CNDA) signed with Intel, it may take up to ten business days to review your request. You will receive a status update within three business days.</span></p>
<p><span>While your application is pending, you can engage with the Developer Zone in the following ways:</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">1	Post a question or comment to our community forums: </li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">Bookmark and follow content of interest. Access your bookmark list in MyIntel </li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">Development software downloads</li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">	Manage your Intel® software license and registration using the License and Entitlement Manager</li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">Access the collaboration platform where developers can share projects: Intel® DevMesh. </li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">Enter contests </li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">Sign up for events: Developer Community and Events </li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">Access performance testing applications</li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">Access developer training at Intel Learn </li>
</ul>
</main>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">Please retain this email for future reference and note that Premier access is associated with this email address {!PRM_Registration_Request__c.PRM_Email_ID__c} only.Your password should be protected as confidential. Your password should be protected as confidential information. Your use of the password and Intel’s websites are governed by Intel’s Terms of Use.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">If you have any questions, please <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/forms/support/my-intel-sign-on-support.html" class="external-link" rel="nofollow">contact us</a>.</span></p>
<tr id="salutationDiv" style="padding-bottom: 5px; height: 52px;">
<td colspan="2" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear', TAHOMA; font-size: 10pt; color: #666666; padding-left: 50px; padding-top: 14px; line-height: 18px; height: 52px;">Sincerely, <br /> Developer Zone Registration Administrator</td>
</tr>
<main>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">Please DO NOT reply to this e-mail message. This is an automated response. To ensure that you continue receiving our e-mails, add us to your address book.</span></p>
</main>
<section>
<p style="text-align: right;"></p>
</section>
<hr /><footer><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"><img class="floating" src="https://www.intel.com/content/dam/logos/intel-logo.png" alt="Intel logo" height="42" width="64" />Intel is committed to protecting your privacy. For more Information, please see the<span> </span><a href="http://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/privacy/intel-privacy-notice.html">Intel Privacy Notice</a>.<span> </span><a href="http://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/privacy/intel-cookie-notice.html">Intel Cookie Notice</a>.</span><br /><br /><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"><a href="http://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/legal/terms-of-use.html">Legal Information</a><span> </span>|<span> </span><a href="http://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/legal/trademarks.html">Trademarks</a><span> </span>|<span> </span><span style="font-size: 1em;">©<span> </span></span>Intel Corporation.</span></footer><footer><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"></span></footer><footer><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"></span></footer><footer><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"></span></footer><footer><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"></span></footer><footer><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"></span></footer></div>
</body>
</html>